    "title": "Explorers blank Milwaukee 9-0, breaks single-season club record for steals - NewsBreak",
    "text": "SIOUX CITY, IA (KCAU) – Explorers pick up another win at home after defeating the Milkmen out of Milwaukee 9-0. DShawn Knowles went 4-for-4 with 4 RBI, while pitcher Austin Drury struck out 6 batters in a complete game win. Sioux City notched its 201st steal of the season, a new club single-season record. Up next, the X’s will look to sweep the Milkmen in the series finale tomorrow night at 7:05. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to SiouxlandProud | Sioux City, IA | News, Weather, and Sports.",
